    "references_and_links": "Bathymetric compilations of the seas around Israel I: The Caspian and Black Seas, J.K. Hall, Geological Survey of Israel, Current Research, Vol. 13, December 2002.",
    "definition": "The grid value at this location is taken from a gridded data set for the Black Sea area. The grid cell at this location contains a sounding(s) from the Black Sea source data set. For the Black Sea, GEBCO Source Identifier (SID) grid cells that do not contain a sounding(s) are coded as \'120\'."
